{"3749720": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Division Resurgence", "steam_appid": 3749720, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<h1>PC Specs</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3749720/extras/93f194b8568c31241bce26b96530e116.avif?t=1786609299\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3749720/extras_big/93f194b8568c31241bce26b96530e116.webp?t=1786609299 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3749720/extras/2e3831b962785ca0c1e3becbfe59b091.poster.avif?t=1786609299\" width=780 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3749720/extras/2e3831b962785ca0c1e3becbfe59b091.webm?t=1786609299\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3749720/extras/2e3831b962785ca0c1e3becbfe59b091.mp4?t=1786609299\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>You are activated as a Strategic Homeland Division agent in the chaotic days following a deadly outbreak. As society collapses, you are the last line of defense for civilians, supply lines, and the city itself. Build your elite agent, rally your squad, and fight to reclaim New York.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3749720/extras/f1f895310efebe8d8304fed6fd7e41cb.avif?t=1786609299\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3749720/extras_big/f1f895310efebe8d8304fed6fd7e41cb.webp?t=1786609299 width=1560 height=81 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3749720/extras/7543409149a98bc84feaa90924aa3dd8.poster.avif?t=1786609299\" width=780 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3749720/extras/7543409149a98bc84feaa90924aa3dd8.webm?t=1786609299\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3749720/extras/7543409149a98bc84feaa90924aa3dd8.mp4?t=1786609299\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Every fight is a test of positioning, timing, and teamwork. Move from cover to cover, flank enemies, and use skills and gadgets to turn the tide. The right tools and the right angle decide the outcome.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3749720/extras/e395b9a95d1a8488dd98df2e1e1c8515.avif?t=1786609299\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3749720/extras_big/e395b9a95d1a8488dd98df2e1e1c8515.webp?t=1786609299 width=1560 height=81 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3749720/extras/64c2b6e3390b91a6d3f4c77178cf728e.poster.avif?t=1786609299\" width=780 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3749720/extras/64c2b6e3390b91a6d3f4c77178cf728e.webm?t=1786609299\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3749720/extras/64c2b6e3390b91a6d3f4c77178cf728e.mp4?t=1786609299\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Explore a shared open world that scales to your group size. Tackle story missions, take on high-value targets, and jump into more than 100 world activities. Go it alone for a methodical approach, or coordinate with friends for fast, surgical strikes.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3749720/extras/f36747f9bbd5ee6a86c2058dd99239dc.avif?t=1786609299\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3749720/extras_big/f36747f9bbd5ee6a86c2058dd99239dc.webp?t=1786609299 width=1560 height=81 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3749720/extras/e374f51e9252be0c8ac61bb50fe85632.poster.avif?t=1786609299\" width=780 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3749720/extras/e374f51e9252be0c8ac61bb50fe85632.webm?t=1786609299\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3749720/extras/e374f51e9252be0c8ac61bb50fe85632.mp4?t=1786609299\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Customize your agent with a huge range of weapons, gear, and mods. Choose a specialization that fits your playstyle, from bulwark for frontline defense to demolitionist for overwhelming firepower. Each specialization brings unique skills and powerful ultimate abilities, and you can change roles as your squad’s needs evolve.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3749720/extras/74b5fb1fe4df785d414c8edc128e8f82.avif?t=1786609299\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3749720/extras_big/74b5fb1fe4df785d414c8edc128e8f82.webp?t=1786609299 width=1560 height=81 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3749720/extras/c6552494e410d4ba11e081be922b6518.poster.avif?t=1786609299\" width=780 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3749720/extras/c6552494e410d4ba11e081be922b6518.webm?t=1786609299\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3749720/extras/c6552494e410d4ba11e081be922b6518.mp4?t=1786609299\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Challenge yourself with activities such as competitive PvP modes and the high‑risk Dark Zone. In PvP, mastering maps, refining your timing, and optimizing your loadouts are key to climbing the ranks. The Dark Zone offers a tense PvPvE experience where elite enemies and rival agents compete for valuable rewards.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3749720/extras/f10cd8659372d2e0745d0287e8807c99.avif?t=1786609299\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3749720/extras_big/f10cd8659372d2e0745d0287e8807c99.webp?t=1786609299 width=1560 height=81 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3749720/extras/dd25df49ae45989effadc4bfa34a9377.poster.avif?t=1786609299\" width=780 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3749720/extras/dd25df49ae45989effadc4bfa34a9377.webm?t=1786609299\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3749720/extras/dd25df49ae45989effadc4bfa34a9377.mp4?t=1786609299\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Expect regular updates that expand the story, refresh the world, and introduce new activities, modes, and rewards. The fight for New York is always evolving, and new challenges are always around the corner.", "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic